 'The roaster needed to stand out on crowded shelves and justify a premium price point.',
 'A restrained monochrome identity with tactile embossing and a distinctive mark that works from cup sleeve to signage.',
 array['Logo & wordmark','Packaging system','Stationery','Brand guidelines'],
 array['Adobe Illustrator','Photoshop','Figma'],
 '/images/work/ember-coffee.jpg', array['/images/work/ember-coffee.jpg'], null, '2026-03-10','Completed',false,4),
('maison-noir-store','Luxe Fashion Store','Luxe Atelier (sample)','Web Development',
